# The card-back photograph. Nintendo / Creatures / GAME FREAK artwork, kept out of built
# images by api/.dockerignore — and a public repository is more exposed than an image, not
# less. What registration actually loads is `pokemon-back.npz`, the ORB descriptors computed
# from it, and that IS committed: it is a fingerprint, not a reproduction.
#
# Anyone cloning this needs their own photograph of a card back and `make bake-reference`.
# docs/DISTRIBUTION.md says so.
**/imaging/assets/pokemon-back.jpg
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# The design log. Kept locally, not published: it is a running account of how and why every
# decision on this project was made, including the commercial ones, and that is a different
# thing from the code. The D-NNN references left behind in CHANGELOG.md and docs/ are
# deliberate — see the note in README.md.
DECISIONS.md
